{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long Live the Emperor</i> is a strategy simulation game where you rule an ancient Chinese dynasty, govern the nation, expand your empire, and ensure your bloodline endures. As long as the emperor lives and the treasury is full, the dynasty will stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlight Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High Degree of Freedom, Define a Unique Character</strong> <br>You can personally shape the appearance of your own character.Whether male emperor or queen, customize your image at will. From the details of facial features to the matching of headdresses and costumes, fully showcase your creativity and aesthetic taste, allowing the character to blend into this grand journey of dynastic power struggles in a unique way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/dd3403754b182e493cef277690a57646.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/318cc3ffc79470d6d7f1548a18aceb55.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Thousand People, a Thousand Faces, Distinctive NPCs</strong> <br>From loyal ministers to scheming powerful officials, from graceful concubines to high-spirited common scholars, every NPC has a unique appearance and background story. Their existence not only makes the world more vivid but also sets the stage for every choice you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisitely Painted, Soul-Stirring CG Events</strong> <br>The game features more than 200 exquisitely detailed CG events. Every scene is carefully designed, enabling you to enjoy visual satisfaction while engaging in strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appoint Officials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen the Nation Select and manage officials, reward loyalty,develop industries,and secure funds for war or suppressing noble clans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/686a67a9a5fc4e0cd734a4595d639b6c.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Scholars</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weaken Nobles Recruit scholars through imperial exams, arrange strategic marriages,and impeach corrupt ministers to restore imperial authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/17f1b8bdf8fe02a06b2dddb203f5bc2a.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select Consorts</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue the Bloodline Marry talented consorts and raise heirs who inherit their parents\u2019traits. Protect them from assassination and help them gain a foothold in court.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/034590c98e6ad517f7b3f7672528422d.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand Territory</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conquer Enemies Lead armies to battle foreign invaders, seize resources, and expand your empire\u2019s dominance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/00806a750e2afff9a236b8aec86dd39e.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynastic Succession</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eternal Legacy Prepare for succession by balancing noble factions, securing loyal ministers, and stabilizing diplomacy to ensure a lasting empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/207ffb5c6f6207dc1be0ffa5d541dbf0.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634340?t=1757063710","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634340?t=1757063710","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/eacf096dc384981434fd72167ffa527309fe8178/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757063710","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/eacf096dc384981434fd72167ffa527309fe8178/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757063710","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3668820,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Long Live the Emperor</i> is a strategy simulation game where you rule an ancient Chinese dynasty, govern the nation, expand your empire, and ensure your bloodline endures. As long as the emperor lives and the treasury is full, the dynasty will stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><s