ubines to high-spirited common scholars, every NPC has a unique appearance and background story. Their existence not only makes the world more vivid but also sets the stage for every choice you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/df97b803d66578439ca92c7a93b4a001.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exquisitely Painted, Soul-Stirring CG Events</strong> <br>The game features more than 200 exquisitely detailed CG events. Every scene is carefully designed, enabling you to enjoy visual satisfaction while engaging in strategic battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.poster.avif?t=1757063710\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.webm?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634340/extras/a9166e7da42c1095841e8589fab9e869.mp4?t=1757063710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Appoint Officials</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengt